":" is het antwoord op de vraag van de boekhouder. "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Blok B"},{"type":"text","text":" en "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" staan erbij zodat je het complete plaatje hebt — die kun je los, later of helemaal niet afnemen. Elk blok is zelfstandig af te nemen."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Wat er al draait:"},{"type":"text","text":" de beveiligde Moneybird-koppeling, het live bezettingsoverzicht per verdieping, het overzicht van alle actieve huurcontracten, de huurderprofielen, het financiële dashboard met bezettingsgraad en maandomzet, en de prijssynchronisatie per opslagruimte. Dat is gebouwd, opgeleverd en zit niet in deze offerte."}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"De blokken"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Blok"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Onderdeel"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Uren"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Bedrag"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"A